Third-party notices for the heatmap's poster themes (themes.ts)

The poster themes' colours (background, text, gradient, water, parks and the
road hierarchy) are adapted from the theme files of maptoposter, as is the
poster layout they are composed with: road widths by class, the top and bottom
gradient fades, and letter-spaced city typography.

  maptoposter - https://github.com/originalankur/maptoposter
  themes/noir.json, blueprint.json, japanese_ink.json, warm_beige.json,
  midnight_blue.json, terracotta.json

